  "boundary":"This programme discovers FDA PMA application and supplement decision records. Composite pma_number + supplement_number preserves record identity and prevents supplements from overwriting the original application. Exact decision semantics come only from FDA decision codes. APPR records provide scoped FDA approval evidence for the corresponding application/supplement, but do not by themselves establish global authorization, the exact current commercial configuration, all-configuration conformance, automatic assessment reopening, or UNESCO/institutional endorsement. H-prefixed HDE and N-prefixed legacy NDA records are out of v0.1 scope."
